Stored operating point solution missing an unknown, opsolve=0 must fail with strictforce=1

ground 0

load "resistor.osdi"
load "capacitor.osdi"

model resistor resistor
model capacitor capacitor
model vsource vsource

subckt a()
  v2 (2 0) vsource dc=0.8 mag=1
  r2 (2 3) resistor r=1k
  c2 (3 0) capacitor c=1u
ends

// Same circuit plus node 5, which the stored solution knows nothing about
subckt b()
  v2 (2 0) vsource dc=0.8 mag=1
  r2 (2 3) resistor r=1k
  c2 (3 0) capacitor c=1u
  r3 (3 5) resistor r=1k
  r4 (5 0) resistor r=1k
ends

control
  abort always

  options strictforce=1

  elaborate circuit("a")
  analysis op1 op store="sol"

  elaborate circuit("b")
  analysis ac2 ac from=1 to=10 mode="dec" points=1 nodeset="sol" opsolve=0
endc
